WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.800
Founder: Sarah, what do you want from this call — say it plainly.

00:02.800 --> 00:05.800
Client: Consistency. I keep starting over and I need a plan that sticks.

00:05.800 --> 00:09.000
Founder: I am writing that down. We lock days, meals, and one weekly check-in.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.200
Client: Yes — that is exactly what I needed to hear.

00:12.200 --> 00:15.000
Founder: Great. You leave with next steps — not more confusion.
